Package: rios
Type: Package
Title: Reference Equations for Impulse Oscillometry
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Saadiq", "Moolla", email = "msmoolla@sun.ac.za", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Stellenbosch University", role = "cph"))
Description: Predicted values, percent predicted, z-scores and lower/upper limits of
    normal for impulse oscillometry (IOS) parameters, using the published reference
    equations of Moitra (2020), Oostveen (2013), Schulz (2013), Berger (2021) and
    Gochicoa-Rangel (2023). R port of the 'pyios' Python package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mithrylblade/pyios
BugReports: https://github.com/mithrylblade/pyios/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: utils, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
